<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>College Departments</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f7f3ff;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding: 14px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background: #eeeeee;
        }

        tr:hover {
            background: #f8f8f8;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🎓 College Departments</h1>

    <p>
        Different departments offer different areas of education
        and help students choose subjects according to their interests.
    </p>

    <table>

        <tr>
            <th>Department</th>
            <th>Main Area</th>
            <th>Example Subjects</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Computer Science</td>
            <td>Technology</td>
            <td>Programming, Database</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Mathematics</td>
            <td>Mathematical Studies</td>
            <td>Algebra, Statistics</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Physics</td>
            <td>Physical Science</td>
            <td>Mechanics, Electronics</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Chemistry</td>
            <td>Chemical Science</td>
            <td>Organic Chemistry</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Commerce</td>
            <td>Business Studies</td>
            <td>Accounting, Economics</td>
        </tr>

    </table>

</div>

</body>
</html>
